  "description": "The Smok Nord 6 Pod Vape Kit is a powerful and versatile addition to the legendary Nord series. It is driven by an extraordinarily large 3800mAh built-in battery, providing extended all-day vaping sessions with the added convenience of fast charging. Capable of delivering anywhere from 5W up to 80W of power, the device offers three distinct output modes to further tailor your experience: NORM, SMOOTH, and BOOST. Navigation is completely redefined through the vivid 1.65-inch HD TFT touch screen. This responsive display allows you to seamlessly swipe and tap to control your settings, check your puff records, and switch between four stunning visual themes including Aurora, The Flash, Flower, and Colour Diamond. The Nord 6 Kit embraces versatility by including two different 2ml pod options in the box. The first is the Nord 6 Side-Fill Pod, which features a non-removable Dual Core Dual Meshed 0.4ohm coil designed for instant ramp-up and massive cloud production. The second is the Nord 6 Top-Fill Empty Pod, which features a convenient spring-loaded filling port hidden beneath a removable top cap. This empty pod is compatible with the Smok RPM 4 coil series with detachable coils.",
